INPUT INSTRUCTIONS

  TITLE: mllpa validation, single-level LPA, TECH11 LMR reference, three classes;
  DATA: FILE = ex7.9.dat;
  VARIABLE:
   NAMES = y1-y4 c;
   USEVARIABLES = y1-y4;
   CLASSES = c(3);
  ANALYSIS:
   TYPE = MIXTURE;
   ESTIMATOR = MLR;
   STARTS = 200 50;
   MITERATIONS = 10000;
   LOGCRITERION = 0.00000001;
   MCONVERGENCE = 0.000001;
  OUTPUT: TECH1 TECH11;
  SAVEDATA:
   RESULTS = lmr3-results.dat;



*** WARNING in MODEL command
  All variables are uncorrelated with all other variables within class.
  Check that this is what is intended.
